              "text": "DID YOU KNOW?\n\nPlaywright 1.63 adds named test locks: tests can declare a shared lock (e.g. 'user-settings') so they never run concurrently. Use this to stop flaky failures when parallel tests hit the same external service or account.\nhttps://github.com/microsoft/playwright/releases/tag/v1.63.0",
